{%- comment -%}
  LBASS HERO — HEADLINE TYPE + REVEAL
  Rendered from snippets/lbass-hero-fx.liquid.

  ── SIZE / LEADING — fights a global !important ──
  snippets/lbass-stamp.liquid sets a GLOBAL:
      h1{ letter-spacing:-.01em;
          font-size:clamp(30px,7vw,58px)!important;
          line-height:1.08!important; }
  `!important` outranks specificity, so `.lbh-h` (0,1,0) lost to a bare `h1`
  (0,0,1) and the headline was capped at 58px. Anchored at `.lbh h1.lbh-h`
  (0,2,1) + !important. That global also applies NEGATIVE tracking to Arabic,
  which pulls cursive joins tight — reset to normal.

  Coupled numbers — change one, re-measure the others:
    font-size   bound by the LONGEST line. "لوك ما كيتعاودش." needs 1162px of
                single-line width at 120px; the wrap allows 1336px.
    line-height 1.24 clears the Arabic ink collision (8px overlap at 1.08).

  ── THE REVEAL ──
  A masked rise, not a fade. The line is a CLIPPING WINDOW: overflow:hidden,
  words start at translateY(115%) and climb out from behind a hard edge. That
  edge is what the eye reads motion against; a fade has none.

  ARABIC: glyph ink is ~1.42em against a 1.24 line-height, so a plain
  overflow:hidden shears descenders off ج ح ع م ي and the sub-baseline dots of
  ب ي ن. The mask is padded .18em and negatively margined the same — clip box
  grows, layout does not move.

  ── WHY animation-name IS GATED BEHIND .lbh-go ──
  If words are created WITH the animation attached, the browser may batch the
  insertion and the animation into one frame; the from-state is never committed
  as its own computed style, so there is nothing to animate from. `.lbh-w`
  therefore ships with animation-name:none, and `.lbh-go` — added by the JS
  only after a committed paint — is the sole rule that supplies it. Do not move
  animation-name back onto `.lbh-w`.

  Duration is 1.1s and travel is a full line height: at 115px type a short,
  small move is over before the eye reaches it.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
.lbh h1.lbh-h{
  font-size:clamp(42px,9vw,132px)!important;
  line-height:1.24!important;
  letter-spacing:normal!important;
  text-wrap:balance;
}

/* the clipping window — padded so Arabic descenders survive the mask */
.lbh .lbh-ln{
  overflow:hidden;
  padding-block:.18em;
  margin-block:-.18em;
}

/* from-state only. NO animation-name here — see the note above. */
.lbh .lbh-w{
  display:inline-block;
  opacity:0;
  transform:translateY(115%);
  animation-name:none;
  animation-duration:1.1s;
  animation-timing-function:cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);
  animation-fill-mode:forwards;
  will-change:transform,opacity;
}

/* the only rule that starts it — added by JS after a committed paint */
.lbh .lbh-ln.lbh-go .lbh-w{ animation-name:lbhRise; }

/* fail-visible backstop, fires at 3.2s — long after the sequence ends */
.lbh .lbh-ln.lbh-shown .lbh-w{ opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); }

@keyframes lbhRise{ to{ opacity:1; transform:translateY(0); } }

@media(max-width:767px){
  .lbh h1.lbh-h{
    font-size:clamp(34px,10.6vw,54px)!important;
    line-height:1.30!important;
  }
  .lbh .lbh-ln{ padding-block:.2em; margin-block:-.2em; }
}

@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .lbh .lbh-w{ opacity:1; transform:none; animation-name:none; }
  .lbh .lbh-ln{ overflow:visible; padding-block:0; margin-block:0; }
}
</style>
